{"id":"n63281-3-7","stage":5,"title":"다그치다 · 加快(脚步等)","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63281-3-7-1","ko":"어머, 지수는 아프다며 학원에 왔네?","zh":"哎呀，智秀说病了，还是来补习班了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머,","meaning":"哎哟，哦","explanation":"어머：哎哟，哦","readings":[{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30195","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}},{"text":"지수는","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}},{"text":"아프다며","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；다며：引用听来的说法，或表示一边这么说一边行动。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아프다며","audio":"/audio/a6a2b645f9ab18508a52.mp3"}},{"text":"학원에","meaning":"补习班，培训班","explanation":"학원：补习班，培训班；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"학원","audio":"/audio/a34f3f1b2a44f15f7e22.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72425","senseId":"2","lemma":"학원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학원에","audio":"/audio/607d3b9b64bdf276b04f.mp3"}},{"text":"왔네?","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔네","audio":"/audio/52d396d9680e0b334cdb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9a1c609712d2db0e","term":"어머","zh":"哎哟，哦","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3","entryId":"30195","definition":"主要是女性因没料到的事情感到惊讶或感叹时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["어머"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"a34f3f1b2a44f15f","term":"학원","zh":"补习班，培训班","audio":"/audio/a34f3f1b2a44f15f7e22.mp3","entryId":"72425","definition":"招收学生并教授其知识、技术及艺术体育等的私立教育机关。","pronunciation":["하권"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/21955703952641e05bf4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63281-3-7-2","ko":"시험이 모레잖아. 아픈 몸을 다그쳐 겨우 왔나 봐.","zh":"后天就考试了。她大概是硬撑着病体才来的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시험이","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시험이","audio":"/audio/3539bd8e76462c84a4b0.mp3"}},{"text":"모레잖아.","meaning":"后天","explanation":"모레：后天；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"모레","audio":"/audio/c91f5f33a1ff69245245.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16134","senseId":"1","lemma":"모레","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모레잖아","audio":"/audio/bbe48afbc67066a7bdfa.mp3"}},{"text":"아픈","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아픈","audio":"/audio/9277b72aca0bb2178064.mp3"}},{"text":"몸을","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몸을","audio":"/audio/384974e1d9816572ab28.mp3"}},{"text":"다그쳐","meaning":"加快(脚步等)，打起(精神)","explanation":"다그치다：加快(脚步等)，打起(精神)；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"다그치다","audio":"/audio/d9483b13dfb7173d90e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63281","senseId":"3","lemma":"다그치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다그쳐","audio":"/audio/e7040d4a1c48a7f48d7e.mp3"}},{"text":"겨우","meaning":"勉强，好不容易","explanation":"겨우：勉强，好不容易","readings":[{"term":"겨우","audio":"/audio/880de41d778f7e2c5cf5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62262","senseId":"1","lemma":"겨우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"겨우","audio":"/audio/880de41d778f7e2c5cf5.mp3"}},{"text":"왔나","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔나","audio":"/audio/e928f4dfbdd4a6b1d413.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"c91f5f33a1ff6924","term":"모레","zh":"后天","audio":"/audio/c91f5f33a1ff69245245.mp3","entryId":"16134","definition":"明天的下一天。","pronunciation":["모ː레"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"d9483b13dfb7173d","term":"다그치다","zh":"加快(脚步等)，打起(精神)","audio":"/audio/d9483b13dfb7173d90e3.mp3","entryId":"63281","definition":"调整疲倦的身体，再次行动。","pronunciation":["다그치다"]},{"id":"880de41d778f7e2c","term":"겨우","zh":"勉强，好不容易","audio":"/audio/880de41d778f7e2c5cf5.mp3","entryId":"62262","definition":"很累地。","pronunciation":["겨우"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/70b7e740f07e128f4a44.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.54,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=63281","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"고급","day":172,"sequenceScore":3.3667,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["哎呀，智秀说病了，还是来补习班了？","后天就考试了。她大概是硬撑着病体才来的。","那个选手为什么被罚下场了？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["哎呀，智秀说病了，还是来补习班了？","后天就考试了。她大概是硬撑着病体才来的。","那个选手为什么被罚下场了？"],"answer":1}]}
